LPL Solve description

  specification description

    part Vars	of sort list[identifier]
	 	import sigSyntax
    part Ops	of sort list[pair[identifier,int]]
	 	import sigSyntax

  end

  query 	of sort combiSystem
         	result of sort combiSystem 
	 	import Solve[Vars,Ops] eqSystem eqMulti combiSystem bool

         	start with (trycombi) query 

end

